  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">큰기쁨</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">서울</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">최윤정</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">안동여중</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선생님 자료를 바탕으로 </span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지구 온난화 수업만들기를 위해 구글설문지와 학습지만들기싸이트를 이용하여 학습지를 작성하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. . </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수업진행은</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지구온난화 이론 내용 파워포인트로 강의 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">유튜브 동여상 보여주기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">( <a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AxGw7On1GtU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AxGw7On1GtU  </a>)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">구글설문지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">( <a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://forms.gle/48AMRuqSn7vNk7oW9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://forms.gle/48AMRuqSn7vNk7oW9 </a>) <span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">로 과제 제출</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--> =&gt; 링크 클릭해서 내용 살펴보시면 됩니다. 지구온난화관련 유튜브 영상으로 수업하실거면 추천합니다.^^</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 구글 설문지안에서 표어를 선택하면 다음 화면으로 넘어가면서 설문지안에 링크가 있는데 그 부분을 클릭하면 학습지만들기 싸이트에서 작성한 파일이 보일 것입니다. 바로 커서를 클릭하여 학습지를 입력할 수 있습니다. 이 싸이트 한번 보시라고 이 수업자료를 올립겁니다. ^^</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생 작품예시파일 첨부합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" data-jsonlen=\"9633\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{ \"documentPr\": { \"di\": \"\", \"dp\": { \"dn\": \"test.hwp\", \"ta\": 1, \"d1\": 5, \"d2\": 1, \"dv\": 0, \"dr\": 1, \"do\": 1, \"vj\": \"1.1\", \"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\", \"av\": \"10, 0, 0, 9015\", \"ao\": \"WIN\", \"ab\": \"32\", \"ar\": \"LE\", \"as\": \"Windows_8\" }, \"dis\": false, \"ds\": { \"ti\": \"\", \"la\": \"ko\", \"cr\": \"\", \"su\": \"\", \"de\": \"\", \"cd\": \"2020-05-19T19:33:17.440Z\", \"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\", \"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\", \"ke\": \"\" } }, \"dh\": { \"do\": { \"pa\": 1, \"fo\": 1, \"en\": 1, \"pi\": 1, \"tb\": 1, \"eq\": 1 }, \"fo\": [ ], \"cd\": { \"tp\": 0, \"lc\": { \"af\": false, \"ui\": false, \"fu\": false, \"dn\": false, \"ul\": false, \"el\": false, \"at\": false, \"tq\": false, \"da\": false, \"dw\": false, \"dj\": false, \"bc\": false, \"bu\": false, \"al\": false, \"ab\": false, \"ap\": false, \"an\": false, \"aa\": false, \"ds\": false, \"de\": false, \"as\": false, \"cp\": false, \"ao\": false, \"et\": false, \"ay\": false, \"am\": false, \"a1\": false, \"bt\": false, \"av\": false, \"dh\": false, \"dp\": false, \"d1\": false, \"mf\": false, \"bl\": false, \"ag\": false, \"dg\": false, \"ae\": false, \"df\": false, \"do\": false, \"dl\": false, \"di\": false, \"d2\": false, \"d3\": false, \"ob